## Why This Is Asked
This question probes practical security design for shared edge environments with tenant isolation, policy distribution, and runtime attestation.

## Key Concepts
- Tenant isolation and WASM sandboxing
- Hardware-backed attestation (TPM/SGX)
- SBOM verification and delta policy updates
- Key management in HSMs and rotation strategies
- Revocation and rollback workflows

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo: verifyPolicy and attestation check
async function loadPolicy(node, policyPackage) {
  const {sig, hash} = policyPackage;
  if (!verifySig(hash, sig, node.publicKey)) throw new Error('Invalid policy');
  if (!await attestationCheck(node)) throw new Error('Untrusted node');
  // apply policy
}
```

